        "original_id": "de50f37d-ffe9-5f14-88f9-fa76cd1642c8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Hayley Williams, Terry Glaze, Zac Farro, Taylor York, Josh Farro\n- Bands: Paramore, Lord Tracy, Pantera\n- Albums: All We Know Is Falling, I Am the Night\n- Roles: singer, songwriter, musician, guitarist, vocalist, lead singer\n\nFacts:\n- Hayley Williams was born on December 27, 1988, and she is an American singer, songwriter, and musician.\n- Terry Glaze was born on November 29, 1964, in Columbus, and he is a Texas-raised singer and guitarist.\n- Terry Glaze is most known for his work in the American heavy metal bands Lord Tracy and Pantera.\n- Paramore consists of Hayley Williams, Zac Farro, and Taylor York.\n- All songs on All We Know Is Falling were written by vocalist Hayley Williams and guitarist Josh Farro.\n- I Am the Night was the last album to feature lead singer Terry Glaze.",
